cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, cite this downstream release and acknowledge the
  upstream FreeToken work that provides its serving-engine foundation.
title: "Qwen3.8 Next 5090 Lab"
type: software
version: "0.1.0-alpha.1"
authors:
  - name: "wimi321"
    website: "https://github.com/wimi321"
repository-code: "https://github.com/wimi321/qwen38-next-5090-lab"
url: "https://github.com/wimi321/qwen38-next-5090-lab"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  An unofficial, reproducible FreeToken downstream for running the text tower
  from the pinned Qwen3.8-Flash-Next NVFP4 checkpoint on one 32 GB RTX 5090,
  using sparse PLE mmap row staging, Query-Selective Attention, four-stream
  gated residuals, and heterogeneous MoE offload.
keywords:
  - Qwen3.8-Flash-Next
  - FreeToken
  - mixture of experts
  - Query-Selective Attention
  - consumer GPU inference
